---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { site } from "../config";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description={`About ${site.name} — file tools that run in your browser and never upload your files.`}
  canonicalPath="/about"
>
  <div class="page">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="page__intro">
        <p class="micro">About</p>
        <h1>File tools that respect your privacy</h1>
        <p class="lede">
          {site.name} is a small independent project with one simple idea: file
          tools should not require you to hand your photos and documents to a
          stranger's server.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="prose">
        <h2>Why this site exists</h2>
        <p>
          Most online file tools work the same way: you upload a file, a server
          processes it, and you download the result. That is convenient, but it
          means your bank statement, ID scan or family photo sits on someone
          else's computer, even if only for a minute.
        </p>
        <p>
          Modern browsers can do most of that work locally. This site exists to
          use that ability for the everyday jobs people actually search for —
          compressing a photo for a form, removing location data before sharing
          a picture, or splitting a PDF without uploading it anywhere.
        </p>

        <h2>What we believe</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Your files are yours.</strong> Processing happens on your
            device, and the files are never sent to us.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>No accounts.</strong> You should not need to create a login
            or give an email address to resize an image.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Honest limits.</strong> If a tool cannot do something, the
            page says so instead of hiding it in small print.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Clean ads only.</strong> When ads are added, they will be
            normal banners, never pop-ups or fake download buttons.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>What we do not do</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>We do not upload, store or look at the files you open.</li>
          <li>We do not ask for your name, email or phone number.</li>
          <li>We do not sell personal data.</li>
          <li>
            We do not offer tools that download from YouTube or other platforms
            — those break copyright rules.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Who is behind it</h2>
        <p>
          {site.name} is built by {site.maker}, an independent developer in{" "}
          {site.location}. It started from a simple frustration: every time a
          document had to be split or a photo cleaned, the only quick options
          asked for an upload.
        </p>
        <p>
          If something is broken, confusing or missing, the contact page is the
          best place to say so.
        </p>

        <p>
          <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/how-we-protect-your-files">
            How we protect your files
          </a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
